title: The investiture debate
new-page: true
on-display: {!
if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.SpainGame) {
    window.SpainGame.renderVote(Q, 'sp-inv-count', 'sanchez');
}
!}

= The investiture debate

The King has proposed you as candidate. Before you set the date, you can still change the arithmetic. This is the projected vote today:

{!<div id="sp-inv-count"></div>!}

You need 176 yes votes in the first ballot, or more yes than no votes in the second.

- @sign_cs: Sign a government agreement with Ciudadanos
- @sign_up: Sign a government agreement with Podemos
- @referendum: Offer the Catalan parties talks on their demands
- @debate: Go to the debate
- @root: Not yet: keep negotiating

@sign_cs
title: Sign a government agreement with Ciudadanos
subtitle: Ciudadanos will vote yes; Podemos will vote no.
choose-if: cs_talks >= 2 and pact_cs = 0 and pact_up = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if pact_up = 1 : Ciudadanos will not join an agreement that includes Podemos. ?][? if pact_up = 0 and cs_talks < 2 : The talks with Ciudadanos are not far enough advanced. ?]
on-arrival: pact_cs = 1; rel_cs += 10; rel_up -= 15; modernisers_dissent -= 5; institutionalists_dissent -= 3; progressives_dissent += 10; trade_unionists_dissent += 5
go-to: sp_investiture

@sign_up
title: Sign a government agreement with Podemos
subtitle: Podemos will vote yes; Ciudadanos will vote no.
choose-if: up_talks >= 2 and pact_up = 0 and pact_cs = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if pact_cs = 1 : Podemos will not support a government built on a deal with Ciudadanos. ?][? if pact_cs = 0 and up_talks < 2 : The talks with Podemos are not far enough advanced. ?]
on-arrival: pact_up = 1; rel_up += 10; rel_cs -= 15; progressives_dissent -= 10; regional_leaders_dissent += 12 + 8*barons_veto; institutionalists_dissent += 6
go-to: sp_investiture

@referendum
title: Offer the Catalan parties talks on their demands
subtitle: Could turn ERC and Convergència's votes into abstentions.
view-if: pact_cs = 0 and referendum_offer = 0
on-arrival: referendum_offer = 1; rel_erc += 15; rel_junts += 15; regional_leaders_dissent += 25 if red_lines = 1; federal_committee_balance -= 12 if red_lines = 1; sanchez_authority -= 6 if red_lines = 1; regional_leaders_dissent += 10 if red_lines = 0
go-to: sp_investiture

[? if red_lines = 1 : You have broken the Federal Committee's resolution. The barons are openly discussing your removal. ?][? if red_lines = 0 : The barons are furious, but the Federal Committee never bound you. ?]

@debate
title: The debate

= The debate

Two days of speeches. What do you build your speech around?

- @speech_change: A government of change
- @speech_reform: A reformist government for all Spaniards
- @speech_attack: The case against Rajoy

@speech_change
on-arrival: rel_up += 3; rel_cs -= 2; member_morale += 3
go-to: vote

@speech_reform
on-arrival: rel_cs += 3; rel_pnv += 2; rel_up -= 2
go-to: vote

@speech_attack
on-arrival: rel_pp -= 8; member_morale += 4
go-to: vote

@vote
on-arrival: {!
if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.SpainGame) {
    window.SpainGame.holdInvestiture(Q, 'sanchez');
}
!}
go-to: won if inv_passes = 1; lost if inv_passes = 0

@won
title: Prime Minister
on-arrival: sanchez_authority += 15; member_morale += 10; sanchismo += 10; federal_committee_balance += 8; sanchez_nominated = 0

= Prime Minister

Yes [+ inv_yes +], no [+ inv_no +], abstentions [+ inv_abstain +]. Pedro Sánchez is invested President of the Government.

@lost
title: Defeated
on-arrival: {!
Q.sanchez_nominated = 0;
if (Q.inv_yes >= 130) { Q.sanchez_authority += 2; } else { Q.sanchez_authority -= 6; }
!}

= Defeated

Yes [+ inv_yes +], no [+ inv_no +], abstentions [+ inv_abstain +]. The chamber rejects your candidacy in both ballots.

[? if investiture_clock > 0 : The two-month clock has started. If no one is invested before it runs out, the Cortes will be dissolved. ?]
